{
  "id": "PSA.59",
  "number": "59",
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "reference": "Psaumes 59",
  "copyright": "Texte libre de droits",
  "verseCount": 18,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "59",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "PSA 59"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "59",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Au chef de musique. Al-Tashkheth",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". De David. Mictam",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "; quand Saül envoya, et qu'on surveilla sa maison, afin de le faire mourir.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Délivre-moi de mes ennemis, ô mon",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "! protège-moi contre ceux qui s'élèvent contre moi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Délivre-moi des ouvriers d'iniquité, et sauve-moi des hommes de sang.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Car voici, ils ont dressé des embûches contre ma vie, des hommes forts se sont assemblés contre moi, – non pour ma transgression, ni pour mon péché, ô",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sans qu'il y ait d'iniquité [en moi]",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ils courent et se préparent ; éveille-toi pour venir à ma rencontre, et regarde.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et toi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ",",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "des armées !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "d'Israël ! réveille-toi pour visiter toutes les nations ; n'use de grâce envers aucun de ceux qui trament l'iniquité. Sélah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils reviennent le soir, ils hurlent comme un chien, et font le tour de la ville.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Voici, de leur bouche ils vomissent l'injure, des épées sont sur leurs lèvres ; car, [disent-ils], qui [nous] entend ?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mais toi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Éternel",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", tu te riras d'eux, tu te moqueras de toutes les nations.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[À cause de] sa force",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", je regarderai à toi ; car",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est ma haute retraite.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Le",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qui use de bonté envers moi me préviendra ;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "me fera voir [mon plaisir] en mes ennemis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne les tue pas, de peur que mon peuple ne l'oublie ; fais-les errer par ta puissance, et abats-les, ô Seigneur, notre bouclier !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "[À cause du] péché de leur bouche, – la parole de leurs lèvres, – qu'ils soient pris dans leur orgueil, et à cause de la malédiction et des mensonges qu'ils profèrent !",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Consume-[les] en ta fureur, consume-[les], et qu'ils ne soient plus, et qu'ils sachent que",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "domine en Jacob jusqu'aux bouts de la terre. Sélah.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et ils reviendront le soir, ils hurleront comme un chien, et feront le tour de la ville.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ils errent çà et là pour trouver à manger ; ils y passeront la nuit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "s'ils ne sont pas rassasiés.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Et moi je chanterai ta force, et, dès le matin, je célébrerai avec joie ta bonté ; car tu m'as été une haute retraite et un refuge au jour où j'étais dans la détresse.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "PSA 59:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ma force ! à toi je chanterai ; car",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "est ma haute retraite, le",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Dieu",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "PSA.59.18",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "PSA.59.18"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "qui use de bonté envers moi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "PSA.59.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "PSA.59.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "PSA.60",
    "number": "60",
